  nonce: a0d4  # a0d4
  message: "BOTH CLAUSES SATISFIED, behavioral evidence on the tip. Clause 2 (every reporting gate readable): the cron log tool shipped 08-14, hardened 08-15, and it is what carried this whole diagnosis. Clause 1 (dev green on every reporting gate): at dev 8e69f40356 — push ✅ AND cron/full-suite ✅ (the FIRST green full-suite cron ever; this item's filing recorded that no green baseline existed). The path from filing to close, for the record: log access → three install failures (INV-vazuh) → one environment-conditional test (INV-kazij) → three owner-fired elimination crons → self-diagnosing assertion → cache-poisoning root cause → dir-keyed fix → validation green. The item's step-3 concern ('full-suite has been REPORTING nothing rather than PASSING') was real and is priced: every fix the cron validated today had been invisible to it since cutover."  # a0d4
